sentences.text:
iii) Considering all the docket orders passed by the learned Single Judge including the one that,
various instructions provided were in variation, as also the docket orders passed by the Co-ordinate Benches in the present appeal raising certain apprehension as per the orders dated 05.05.2025, in the light of the submissions advanced, as also in the order dated 07.07.2025, it shall now be clearly stated in the affidavit to be filed as to why the instructions at variance were provided; and by whom;
if by RDO, Sullurpet, with respect to such instructions, the RDO shall file his personal affidavit,
explaining such conduct.

